<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/17th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">First War of Castro</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1641–1644</span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The First War of Castro was fought from 1641 to 1644 between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pope-urban-viii">Pope Urban VIII</a>, supported by his Barberini nephews, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/odoardo-farnese-duke-of-parma">Odoardo Farnese, Duke of Parma</a>, over the Duchy of Castro and the Farnese family's debts. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a>, Tuscany and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/modena">Modena</a> joined Parma against papal expansion. The papal forces fared badly, and the peace of 1644 restored Castro to the Farnese.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/first-war-of-castro.jpg" alt="First War of Castro" width="320" height="236" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Joan Blaeu · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Joan_Blaeu_-_Theatrum_civitatum_et_admirandorum_Italiae_-_page_371_Castro_21_(crop).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
